        "content": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"ko\">\n<head>\n<meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n<meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n<title>한국어 문법 필기 노트 (A는 B가 아닙니다)</title>\n<script>\nwindow.MathJax = { tex: { inlineMath: [['$','$']], displayMath: [['$$','$$']] } };\n</script>\n<script src=\"https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/npm/mathjax@3/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js\" async></script>\n<style>\n  body{\n    margin:0;\n    padding:30px 0;\n    background:#3a3a3a;\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:center;\n  }\n  .page{\n    width:560px;\n    min-height:760px;\n    background-color:#f7f4ec;\n    background-image: radial-gradient(circle, #e3ded0 1px, transparent 1px);\n    background-size: 14px 14px;\n    box-shadow: 0 0 25px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);\n    padding:28px 26px 40px 26px;\n    font-family: 'Segoe Print','Comic Sans MS', cursive;\n    font-size:15px;\n    line-height:1.55;\n    color:#1a1a1a;\n    position:relative;\n  }\n  .red{ color:#c0392b; }\n  .pink{ color:#d63384; }\n  .indent{ margin-left:22px; }\n  .indent2{ margin-left:40px; }\n  .section{ margin-bottom:14px; }\n  .num{ font-weight:bold; }\n  .small-note{ font-size:14px; }\n\n  .example-block{\n    display:flex;\n    justify-content:space-between;\n    margin-top:6px;\n    margin-bottom:10px;\n  }\n  .example-left{\n    display:flex;\n    flex-direction:column;\n    gap:4px;\n  }\n  .example-right{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:auto auto;\n    column-gap:26px;\n    row-gap:4px;\n    font-size:14px;\n    align-content:start;\n  }\n  .pair span:first-child{ color:#1a1a1a; margin-right:4px; }\n  .pair span:last-child{ color:#c0392b; }\n\n  .vocab-title{ margin-top:16px; font-weight:bold; }\n  .vocab-grid{\n    display:grid;\n    grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr 1fr;\n    row-gap:6px;\n    column-gap:10px;\n    margin-top:6px;\n    font-size:14px;\n  }\n  .vocab-cell{ white-space:nowrap; }\n  .vocab-cell .kr{ color:#1a1a1a; }\n  .vocab-cell .cn{ color:#c0392b; margin-left:3px; }\n\n  .placeholder{\n    position:absolute;\n    top:8px;\n    right:-4px;\n    width:70px;\n    height:60px;\n    background:repeating-linear-gradient(45deg,#ddd,#ddd 4px,#eee 4px,#eee 8px);\n    border:1px solid #ccc;\n    font-size:9px;\n    color:#777;\n    display:flex;\n    align-items:center;\n    justify-content:center;\n    text-align:center;\n    transform:rotate(3deg);\n  }\n</style>\n</head>\n<body>\n<div class=\"page\">\n\n  <div class=\"placeholder\">[Photo corner:<br>curled page edge]</div>\n\n  <!-- Section 1 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div><span class=\"num\">1.</span> A是B的 &nbsp; A은/는 B이/가 아닙니다</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">(저는) 학생이 아닙니다.</div>\n    <div class=\"indent red\">我不是学生.</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-top:8px;\">이 사람은 가수가 아닙니다.</div>\n    <div class=\"indent red\">这个人不是歌手.</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Section 2 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div><span class=\"num\">2.</span> \"이\"的发音规则</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">① \"이\" 位于词首遇到 \"ㅇ\"时,发[이].</div>\n    <div class=\"indent2\">의사, 의자</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-top:6px;\">② 当\"이\"位于词中或遇到其他辅音时,[이]</div>\n    <div class=\"indent2\">수의사, 희망</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\" style=\"margin-top:6px;\">③ 当\"이\"作为\"的\"意思时, [예], 태양의 후예</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Section 3 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div><span class=\"num\">3.</span> A是B的C &nbsp; A은/는 B의 C입니다.</div>\n    <div class=\"indent\">[예]</div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- Section 4 -->\n  <div class=\"section\">\n    <div><span class=\"num\">4.</span> A不是B的C &nbsp; A은/는 B의 C이/가 아닙니다.</div>\n\n    <div class=\"example-block\">\n      <div class=\"example-left\">\n        <div>이것은 무엇입니까?</div>\n        <div>이것은 가방입니다.</div>\n        <div>이것은 가방이 아닙니다.</div>\n      </div>\n      <div class=\"example-right\">\n        <div class=\"pair\"><span>그럼요,</span><span>当然</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pair\"><span>친구</span><span>朋友</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pair\"><span>담연화당然?</span><span></span></div>\n        <div class=\"pair\"><span>우산</span><span>雨伞</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pair\"><span>영어</span><span>英文</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pair\"><span>시계</span><span>表</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pair\"><span>모르겠습니다</span><span>我不知道</span></div>\n        <div class=\"pair\"><span></span><span></span></div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <!-- 生词 vocabulary section -->\n  <div class=\"vocab-title\">生词:</div>\n  <div class=\"vocab-grid\">\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">이것</span><span class=\"cn\">这个</span></div>\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">무엇[뭐]</span><span class=\"cn\">什么</span></div>\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">제=저의</span><span class=\"cn\">我的</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">가방</span><span class=\"cn\">书包</span></div>\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">아니요</span><span class=\"cn\">不是</span></div>\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">이/가 아닙니다</span><span class=\"cn\">不是</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">그래요</span><span class=\"cn\">是吗</span></div>\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">그럼</span><span class=\"cn\">那么</span></div>\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">한국어</span><span class=\"cn\">韩语</span></div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">책</span><span class=\"cn\">书</span></div>\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">알겠습니다</span><span class=\"cn\">我知道了(明白了)</span></div>\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"></div>\n\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">그것</span><span class=\"cn\">那个</span></div>\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">저것</span><span class=\"cn\">那个(距离更远)</span></div>\n    <div class=\"vocab-cell\"><span class=\"kr\">핸드백</span><span class=\"cn\">手提包</span> &nbsp; <span class=\"kr\">백백</span><span class=\"cn\">背包</span></div>\n  </div>\n\n</div>\n</body>\n</html>"
